  "name": "FM token credits its liquidity fees to the pair balance without sync",
  "summary": "FmToken._transfer moved 150,000 FM of accumulated liquidity fees from the token contract into the balance of its registered FM/USDT pair 0x6f5e1846 on every transfer not sent by the pair, without syncing the pair, so the excess could be skimmed by anyone. A skim bot first took the credits left by ordinary transfers; the attacker then made 500 transfers per transaction to credit 75M FM at a time, skimmed it, and sold it into the liquid FM/USDT pair 0x5053db13. About 1.2B FM, nearly the whole fee balance, left the token contract.",
