  "notes": [
    "Anchor is the first skim of the FM/USDT pair 0x6f5e1846 since its creation, by a generic skim bot (0x472be56a) 5,300 blocks before the reported attacker; it sold the 898,650 FM it took. Earlier FM outflows from that pair without a swap are liquidity removals. The campaign lists every later skim: the bot's second, the attacker's 16, another skim bot's (0xfc885a7f) and a copycat's 53M FM (0xef0399ef).",
    "Immutable token with the 150,000 FM credit and swapAndLiquifyEnabled fixed since deployment; the owner made no configuration call after transferring ownership at block 14468381.",
    "Loss is the PancakeSwap FM/USDT pair 0x5053db13's USDT depletion in the exploiters' sales of the skimmed FM (refs; pass them to loss.mjs with --tx), valued at what they realised since the sales crashed FM (rule 12). The 1.2B FM taken from the token contract is not valued separately."
